{"id":"n76869-1-9","stage":4,"title":"지원서 · 申请书","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76869-1-9-1","ko":"취직 준비는 잘되어 가니?","zh":"找工作的准备进行得怎么样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"취직","meaning":"就业，就职","explanation":"취직：就业，就职","readings":[{"term":"취직","audio":"/audio/e75e43b242732d24d26d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72152","senseId":"1","lemma":"취직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"준비는","meaning":"准备","explanation":"준비：准备；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"준비","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86434","senseId":"1","lemma":"준비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘되어","meaning":"顺利，好","explanation":"잘되다：顺利，好；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잘되다","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62302","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가니?","meaning":"到，进展到","explanation":"가다：到，进展到；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"18","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e75e43b242732d24","term":"취직","zh":"就业，就职","audio":"/audio/e75e43b242732d24d26d.mp3","entryId":"72152","definition":"找到一份工作而去单位上班。","pronunciation":["취ː직"]},{"id":"9ce364fc9c6f2a1c","term":"준비","zh":"准备","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3","entryId":"86434","definition":"事先筹备。","pronunciation":["준ː비"]},{"id":"2bf32329a9311a6d","term":"잘되다","zh":"顺利，好","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3","entryId":"62302","definition":"事情朝着理想的方向发展。","pronunciation":["잘되다","잘뒈다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"到，进展到","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"事情在进行。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b586125191360bd047ca.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n76869-1-9-2","ko":"여러 회사에 지원서를 냈는데 한 곳에서만 면접을 보라고 연락이 왔어요.","zh":"我向好几家公司投了简历，只有一家联系我说要让我去参加面试。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여러","meaning":"多个，许多，多种","explanation":"여러：多个，许多，多种","readings":[{"term":"여러","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17300","senseId":"1","lemma":"여러","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사에","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지원서를","meaning":"申请书，志愿书","explanation":"지원서：申请书，志愿书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지원서","audio":"/audio/aa637ada62d837517987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76869","senseId":"1","lemma":"지원서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"냈는데","meaning":"交，提交，发","explanation":"내다：交，提交，发；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"내다","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89906","senseId":"14","lemma":"내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳에서만","meaning":"处，个","explanation":"곳：处，个；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"3","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"면접을","meaning":"面试","explanation":"면접：面试；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"면접","audio":"/audio/61f79720989225b6f896.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16121","senseId":"2","lemma":"면접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보라고","meaning":"考，参加","explanation":"보다：考，参加；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"12","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연락이","meaning":"联络，联系","explanation":"연락：联络，联系；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연락","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14013","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔어요.","meaning":"来，传来","explanation":"오다：来，传来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"6","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9132eb626207a0b0","term":"여러","zh":"多个，许多，多种","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3","entryId":"17300","definition":"很多数量的。","pronunciation":["여러"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"aa637ada62d83751","term":"지원서","zh":"申请书，志愿书","audio":"/audio/aa637ada62d837517987.mp3","entryId":"76869","definition":"希望进某个组织或负责某事而填写后提交的资料。","pronunciation":["지원서"]},{"id":"3c7ab23f77767092","term":"내다","zh":"交，提交，发","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3","entryId":"89906","definition":"交出或寄出文件、资料、书信等。","pronunciation":["내ː다"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"处，个","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"计算地点或位置的数量单位。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"61f79720989225b6","term":"면접","zh":"面试","audio":"/audio/61f79720989225b6f896.mp3","entryId":"16121","definition":"主要在笔试后进行，以跟应试者见面的形式来考察对方的人品、言行的考试。","pronunciation":["면ː접"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"考，参加","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了鉴定知识水平或能力而进行考试。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"b1c3b94a6a87c1f5","term":"연락","zh":"联络，联系","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3","entryId":"14013","definiti